{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25934","headline":"经秦皇墓 · 鲍溶","name":"经秦皇墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左岗青虬盘，右坂白虎踞。\n谁识此中陵，祖龙藏身处。\n别爲一天地，下入三泉路。\n珠华翔青鸟，玉影耀白兔。\n山河一易姓，万事随人去。\n白昼盗开陵，玄冬火焚树。\n哀哉送死厚，乃爲弃身具。\n死者不复知，回看汉文墓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}